entries.en:
if I make things clear,
I can pass a verdict with confidence. I want to pass a verdict that even 50 years later,
I can still say that I was right.

And we must not
let the true criminals get away. This duty is shared by the court,
the police, and the prosecution.

It's hard enough to arrange a schedule
for all these lay judges. If you don't make their schedules fit,
we can't have a trial!
